  "description": "A young girl with fragile mental stability. Many who crossed her path only thought she was crazy. She claims to hear voices but nobody believes her, not even the inhabitants of her native village. Nonetheless, she managed to obtain a post with the local guards. Despite her instability, she could stay thanks to her ability with the sword and sense of duty. Later, she joined Heinrich's hunting party and took part in humanity’s rebellion against the Shapeshifters, pledging her support to its instigators. Her natural ability was not by chance: she descended from a unique lineage whose distinctive features had been lost throughout the centuries. She had been the first in a very long time to have the mysterious ability to hear certain voices.",
  "summon": "Why won't anybody believe me?! These voices...",
  "fusion": "No... I'm not crazy!",
